# Dependencies. 1067 of this project's 1098 files live here, and two of them are
# platform-specific esbuild binaries (darwin-arm64 AND linux-arm64 — see
# hq/scripts/ensure-esbuild-platforms.mjs for why both are present). Committing them would put
# 63MB of machine-specific binaries in the history and make every checkout wrong on some host.
